[http://www.amazon.com/gp/offer-listing/0966028309?seller=A2STSAFJP9WB2P|The Complete Lojban Language] by John Woldemar Cowan is now available to buy from Amazon.com, and just in time for the holiday season.  Treat yourself or someone special!

